1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,864
WenQuest takes its name from a line by Zhu Xi:

2
00:00:02,884 --> 00:00:05,869
the pond stays clear because fresh water keeps flowing in.

3
00:00:06,339 --> 00:00:10,878
We build an AI-native platform that runs from the classroom all the way to

4
00:00:10,898 --> 00:00:11,618
the factory.

5
00:00:12,638 --> 00:00:15,937
First, the learning platform. Hand it a pile of materials,

6
00:00:15,957 --> 00:00:17,139
or just one sentence,

7
00:00:17,609 --> 00:00:20,988
and the AI builds a complete course: notes, slides, homework,

8
00:00:21,008 --> 00:00:21,991
quizzes and exams.

9
00:00:23,011 --> 00:00:25,178
Behind the courses are nine textbooks of our own,

10
00:00:25,198 --> 00:00:26,874
each chapter with code and animations,

11
00:00:27,344 --> 00:00:31,347
and virtual labs that run in the browser, in Chinese and English.

12
00:00:32,367 --> 00:00:34,439
Content creation is AI-driven too:

13
00:00:34,459 --> 00:00:37,578
one sentence becomes an animated whiteboard lesson,

14
00:00:38,048 --> 00:00:41,280
one paragraph an engineering-grade 3D film.

15
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,949
Second, the digital factory:

16
00:00:43,969 --> 00:00:47,466
a teaching industrial park that runs on real business data.

17
00:00:47,936 --> 00:00:51,928
In the gearbox and robot plants, orders, process plans, quality,

18
00:00:51,948 --> 00:00:54,687
equipment and energy all live in the system.

19
00:00:55,707 --> 00:00:59,366
The same platform serves companies: design release, CNC programming,

20
00:00:59,386 --> 00:01:01,800
simulation, ERP and a factory command center,

21
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:06,022
plus industry software for sewing machines, cams and bearings.

22
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:09,475
For a sewing-machine maker, for example,

23
00:01:09,495 --> 00:01:13,278
it is one line and one set of data from design to after-sales.

24
00:01:14,298 --> 00:01:16,959
Third, assessment: every learning step leaves evidence,

25
00:01:16,979 --> 00:01:19,737
and course-objective reports are generated automatically.

26
00:01:20,207 --> 00:01:23,322
The Campus Hub rolls it all up for audits and accreditation.

27
00:01:24,342 --> 00:01:28,131
You can open every one of them from the overview on our homepage.

28
00:01:28,151 --> 00:01:29,068
Come and try it.
